The project is named "PhysicsSim".
The version is "1.0.0".
Bring in "ui" as ui.

Set x to 200.
Set y to 200.
Set speed_x to 300.
Set speed_y to 300.

Please open a window with width 800 and height 600 titled "Syl Physics Engine".

Repeat while the window is not closing:
    Set dt to delta time.

    Set x to (x + speed_x * dt).
    Set y to (y + speed_y * dt).

    If (x > 780):
        Set speed_x to (speed_x * -1).
    If (x < 20):
        Set speed_x to (speed_x * -1).
    If (y > 580):
        Set speed_y to (speed_y * -1).
    If (y < 20):
        Set speed_y to (speed_y * -1).

    Begin drawing.
    Clear the background to "black".
    Draw circle at x, y with radius 20 colored "red".
    Draw text "Syl Physics" at position 10, 10.
    End drawing.
